### 2. `shoplite-app/.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Environment variables (NEVER commit real secrets)
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Test & coverage reports
coverage/
junit.xml

# SonarQube local cache
.scannerwork/

# Logs
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*

# OS & Editor artifacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp